---
import ContentLayout from '@/layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
import { site } from '@lib/site';
---

<ContentLayout
  title="Terms of sale"
  description="Terms of sale: one-of-a-kind items, pricing with duties included, 30-day returns, the authenticity guarantee, and trade terms."
  h1="Terms of sale"
  updated="2026-09-28"
  toc={[
    { id: 'items', label: 'One-of-a-kind items' },
    { id: 'pricing', label: 'Pricing & tax' },
    { id: 'returns', label: 'Returns' },
    { id: 'guarantee', label: 'Authenticity guarantee' },
    { id: 'trade', label: 'Trade accounts' },
    { id: 'liability', label: 'Liability' },
  ]}
>
  <p>
    [EDIT: have a lawyer review before launch.] These terms apply to every purchase from{' '}
    {site.dealerName}.
  </p>
  <section id="items" class="scroll-mt-24">
    <h2>One-of-a-kind items</h2>
    <p>
      Every rug is a single, unique item. Checkout holds a rug for 30 minutes while you pay; if
      payment isn’t completed the hold releases automatically. In the rare case two orders complete
      for the same rug because of a technical fault, the earlier payment wins and the other is
      refunded in full immediately.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section id="pricing" class="scroll-mt-24">
    <h2>Pricing &amp; tax</h2>
    <p>
      Prices are in US dollars and include insured shipping to US addresses and all import duties
      and tariffs. Sales tax is calculated and added at checkout where required. Prices are fixed;
      we do not negotiate and we do not run fake discounts.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section id="returns" class="scroll-mt-24">
    <h2>Returns</h2>
    <p>
      See the <a href="/returns">returns page</a>: 30 days from delivery, original condition, refund
      within 5 business days of receipt. Return shipping: {site.returnShipping}.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section id="guarantee" class="scroll-mt-24">
    <h2>Authenticity guarantee</h2>
    <p>
      If an independent appraiser finds that a rug isn’t what we described on its product page and
      certificate, we refund you in full, including return shipping.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section id="trade" class="scroll-mt-24">
    <h2>Trade accounts</h2>
    <p>
      Trade pricing is for approved design professionals and is applied by promotion code. Memo
      terms are agreed in writing per project.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section id="liability" class="scroll-mt-24">
    <h2>Liability</h2>
    <p>
      Our liability for any order is limited to the amount you paid for it. Nothing here limits
      rights you have under law.
    </p>
  </section>
</ContentLayout>
